#: ../../../release/dev/SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH_target_property.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :prop_tgt:`SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` target property was added to control "
"whether a target is installed without an RPATH on a per-target basis. It is "
"initialized by the :variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH` variable. See "
"policy :policy:`CMP0229`."
msgstr ""
